1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,930
Before you invest in AI for your GTM

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:05,160
motion, you need to know if your team is

3
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,330
actually ready to use it.

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:09,240
AI readiness is not about technology.

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:12,420
It is about data, process, and adoption

6
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,050
capacity.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,740
The data test: Is your CRM data clean

8
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,970
enough to train a model on?

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,420
If your pipeline hygiene is poor, your

10
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,250
AI outputs will be unreliable.

11
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,880
The process test: Are your core GTM

12
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,120
processes documented and consistently

13
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:29,760
executed?

14
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,510
AI optimizes a process.

15
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,680
It cannot define one that does not

16
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:35,160
exist.

17
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,890
The adoption test: Do your reps trust

18
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,310
the tools they already have?

19
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,980
If adoption of existing technology is

20
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:45,290
low, adding AI will not improve it.

21
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,050
And the leadership test: Is there an

22
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,690
executive sponsor who will drive

23
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,280
accountability for AI usage?

24
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:54,160
Without that, every AI initiative

25
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,380
becomes optional and eventually ignored.

26
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,270
Running this test before you buy is not

27
00:00:59,330 --> 00:00:59,930
pessimism.

28
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:02,600
It is how you avoid spending six figures

29
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,950
on a tool that sits unused because the

30
00:01:04,990 --> 00:01:06,080
foundation was not ready.

31
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:07,740
Build the foundation.

32
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,630
Then build on it.

33
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:11,450
Follow A-Gent for the agent-first GTM

34
00:01:11,490 --> 00:01:11,880
playbook.
